/E (Organizations assess whether an impermissible use or disclosure triggers notification. For breaches affecting 500 or more individuals, notify affected persons, HHS \(via the breach portal\), and prominent media within 60 days of discovery. Breaches under 500 are logged and reported to HHS annually. 2025 trend: Rectangle Health and other analyses point to regulatory movement toward 24-hour notification for certain high-risk breaches, aligning HIPAA with state laws and cybersecurity frameworks. Organizations are building accelerated playbooks now.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [22]
>>
