/E (The Privacy Rule governs PHI use, disclosure, and patient rights. The Security Rule mandates administrative, physical, and technical safeguards for ePHI. The Breach Notification Rule sets notification obligations and timelines. Organizations commonly align policies and training to all three.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [14]
>>
