/P 87 0 R
/E (The Security Rule specifies five technical standards: access control \(unique IDs, role-based permissions\), audit controls \(logging and monitoring\), integrity \(change detection\), person or entity authentication \(passwords, MFA\), and transmission security \(encryption in transit\).)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [16]
>>
